<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 14:36:44 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>🫣 玩转 BitCam</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9ecbf8579e3</link><description>&lt;p&gt;🫣 玩转 BitCam&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="🫣 Playing with BitCam " height="4032" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/atog/6a9ecbf8579e3.png" width="3024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://atog.some.pics"&gt;@atog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 14:36:44 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>The beginning</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9ec68f357ae</link><description>&lt;p&gt;开端&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="The leaves of a birch tree hang against a grey sky; some are already yellow, but partially glimmering in the pale sunlight that manages to break through the cloud cover." height="3750" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6a9ec68f357ae.jpg" width="3000"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 14:13:39 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a9ec5ebe401f</link><description>&lt;p&gt;周日静默&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A clear sky just before sunrise, with the horizon turning from orange to yellow and then to a very pale blue. The landscape below stands out against it like a black silhouette, as do the geese flying past. " height="2434" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6a9ec5ebe401f.jpg" width="3407"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 14:10:54 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>留下你的印记</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9ec56c98479</link><description>&lt;p&gt;留下你的印记&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Two drink rings left by cups or glasses on a dark wooden table next to an orange, oval tea light holder" height="3918" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6a9ec56c98479.jpg" width="2938"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 14:08:48 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>寂静</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9ec433957af</link><description>&lt;p&gt;寂静&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Set slightly higher up, overlooking a wide, empty beach and a pale blue, almost turquoise, virtually still sea. The sky is cloudy but undramatic, and only grows slightly darker towards the horizon. In the left-hand foreground, a few blades of grass protrude into the picture" height="2844" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6a9ec433957af.jpg" width="3794"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 14:03:35 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>咖啡之爱</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9ec38ce9698</link><description>&lt;p&gt;咖啡之爱&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Close-ups of a latte macchiato with a heart-shaped foam design. In the background, you can see parts of a straw hat with a bow. A play of shadows cast by the sun and the trees falls across the whole scene." height="3000" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6a9ec38ce9698.jpg" width="4000"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 14:00:48 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>日光浴</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9ec2fa05cd4</link><description>&lt;p&gt;日光浴&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A dragonfly is perched on a white cord in the sunlight. The cord stretches diagonally across the picture." height="2652" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6a9ec2fa05cd4.jpg" width="3240"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 13:58:21 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>白昼的最后一缕光</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9ec23e6dd68</link><description>&lt;p&gt;白昼的最后一缕光&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Sunset over a lake, where the colours of the sky is reflected in the water. The trees and bushes stand out like silhouettes against the sky" height="3000" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6a9ec23e6dd68.jpg" width="4000"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 13:55:14 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>单色星期一</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9ec1a5b8c1d</link><description>&lt;p&gt;单色星期一&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A black-and-white photograph of a pair of ‘aviator sunglasses’ resting against the stem of a glass.  A church tower is reflected in one of the lenses." height="2994" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6a9ec1a5b8c1d.jpg" width="2944"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 13:52:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>蓝上叠蓝。凯夫拉维克 → 爱丁堡。快到家了。</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9e9514d7295</link><description>&lt;p&gt;蓝上叠蓝。凯夫拉维克 → 爱丁堡。快到家了。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Blue on blue. KEF —&amp;gt; EDI. Almost home." height="1995" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/benjamin/6a9e9514d7295.jpg" width="2822"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://benjamin.some.pics"&gt;@benjamin&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 10:42:33 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>